# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API for the latest version of Qiskit Fermions"
msgstr "Installa la Python API per l'ultima versione di Qiskit Fermions"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API"
msgstr "Installa la Python API"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the Python API {#install-the-python-api}"
msgstr "Installa la Python API {#install-the-python-api}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prerequisiti {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. Use [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Per prima cosa, crea un ambiente minimale con solo Python installato. Usa gli [ambienti virtuali Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Attiva il tuo nuovo ambiente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install this package: from PyPI or from source. The preferred method is to install from PyPI:\n"
msgstr "Ci sono due modi principali per installare questo pacchetto: da PyPI o dai sorgenti. Il metodo preferito è installare da PyPI:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Installare da PyPI {#install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from source {#install-from-source}"
msgstr "Installare dai sorgenti {#install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Se prevedi di sviluppare nel repository, dovresti installare dai sorgenti.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, Qiskit must be installed in the same Python environment that you install `qiskit-fermions` in. The simplest way to do this is from PyPI, but you can install Qiskit from source if you want to.\n"
msgstr "Per prima cosa, Qiskit deve essere installato nello stesso ambiente Python in cui installi `qiskit-fermions`. Il modo più semplice è da PyPI, ma puoi installare Qiskit dai sorgenti se lo desideri.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, clone the `qiskit-fermions` repository.\n"
msgstr "Poi clona il repository `qiskit-fermions`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Now, install the Rust toolchain, upgrade pip, and enter the repository. Refer to the [Rust documentation](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) for instructions on installing the toolchain.\n"
msgstr "Ora installa la toolchain Rust, aggiorna pip ed entra nel repository. Consulta la [documentazione di Rust](https://www.rust-lang.org/tools/install) per le istruzioni sull'installazione della toolchain.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the remaining `build` dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Installa le restanti dipendenze `build`. Se prevedi di sviluppare nel repository, installa le dipendenze `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-fermions` to the virtual environment.\n"
msgstr "Il passo successivo è installare `qiskit-fermions` nell'ambiente virtuale.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Hint\">\n"
msgstr "<DoqAdmonition type=\"note\" title=\"Suggerimento\">\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also perform an editable install while still compiling the underlying Rust crate in `release` mode:\n"
msgstr "  Puoi anche eseguire un'installazione modificabile compilando comunque il crate Rust sottostante in modalità `release`:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "</DoqAdmonition>\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Some features rely on optional dependencies. To install all of them, use the `all` extra:\n"
msgstr "  Alcune funzionalità dipendono da dipendenze opzionali. Per installarle tutte, usa l'extra `all`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  Refer to the `[project.optional-dependencies]` section of [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions/blob/main/pyproject.toml) to see which dependency groups are available.\n"
msgstr "  Consulta la sezione `[project.optional-dependencies]` di [pyproject.toml](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions/blob/main/pyproject.toml) per vedere quali gruppi di dipendenze sono disponibili.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can optionally verify that the installation was successful. The simplest test is to try and import one of the classes provided by the `qiskit-fermions` package, as in the following example:\n"
msgstr "Puoi facoltativamente verificare che l'installazione sia riuscita. Il test più semplice è provare a importare una delle classi fornite dal pacchetto `qiskit-fermions`, come nell'esempio seguente:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If this completes successfully, your installation worked.\n"
msgstr "Se si completa con successo, la tua installazione ha funzionato.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  You can also run the entire Python test suite:\n"
msgstr "  Puoi anche eseguire l'intera suite di test Python:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  To additionally run the tests that exercise optional dependencies, install the extras and use the `testoptional` target:\n"
msgstr "  Per eseguire inoltre i test che coinvolgono le dipendenze opzionali, installa gli extra e usa il target `testoptional`:\n"
